// # Opm Docs Index — Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Index of the user-facing docs for opm.
//
// Setup: RFC-0005. Website Source: openOODA/opm/docs/.
//        They travel with the package.
//
// Beats:
//   1. INSTALL.oot — how to run opm. Git tag. No VERSION file.
//   2. versioning.oot — git-tag version, api_surface=10, no VERSION file.
//   3. cli.oot — user-facing CLI reference for `opm <subcommand>`.
//   4. MANIFEST.oot — the package manifest format.
//   5. REGISTRY.oot — CAS hashes, capability declarations, search, install.

import "INSTALL.oot";
import "versioning.oot";
import "cli.oot";
import "MANIFEST.oot";
import "REGISTRY.oot";
